            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You have reached the pinnacle of the reanimator's craft: the ability to raise nearly any corpse or skeleton as a gruesome mockery of the creature it once was. You learn the shambling horror focus spell. Your focus pool increases by 1 Focus Point."
